Native emoji picker presentation metadata

Derived from emoji-picker-react 4.19.1, pinned by the desktop package-lock.json.
Upstream: https://github.com/ealush/emoji-picker-react
The generator verifies the published archive and source SHA-256 hashes.
Ordered Unicode/search/category/variant metadata and four SVG assets are reused; no React or remote image runtime is embedded.

